# Third-party notices

Status: source-repository dependency and copied-material notice.

This file records selected direct runtime dependencies and third-party material
copied into the repository. `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`,
`apps/lab-web/package.json`, and `apps/lab-web/package-lock.json` are the exact
dependency declaration and resolution authorities. Optional development,
build-backend, research-GPU, and training dependencies are not exhaustively
restated here.

The tagged source tree and GitHub-generated source archives contain no compiled
application binary, container image, platform wheel, emitted browser bundle,
model or checkpoint package, training dataset, or capture-media binary.
Manually uploaded release assets, if published, are
separate distributions and are not covered by this source-repository notice.

`make release-evidence` preserves selected lock-derived CycloneDX reports,
repository notices, declaration and lock inputs, a manifest, and checksums for
one clean Git commit. It records mechanical evidence; it does not determine
license compatibility or legal clearance.

