## Build tooling

Cubed Core pins uv 0.11.16 to resolve and synchronize `uv.lock` and to produce
ephemeral CycloneDX 1.5 checks. The Python distribution declares
`MIT OR Apache-2.0` and ships both primary license files. CI pins the official
`astral-sh/setup-uv` v8.1.0 action by commit, while the Docker build mounts the
official multi-architecture uv 0.11.16 image by digest only for the dependency
installation step; the uv binary is not retained in the final runtime image.
Source: <https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/tree/0.11.16>.

`make release-evidence SOURCE_REF=<tag> OUTPUT=<outside-path>` requires the
pinned uv 0.11.16, Node 22.23.1, and npm 10.9.8 generators. It emits
deterministic CycloneDX 1.5 reports for the five Python lock profiles and the
frontend lock, copies the repository license/notices and declaration/lock
inputs from their exact Git blobs, verifies byte parity with the clean
worktree, and binds them to one commit with `manifest.json` and `SHA256SUMS`.
Artifact and dependency scope is summarized in `docs/LICENSING.md`.

