## Scope of this notice

This notice and `make release-evidence` cover dependency declarations, selected
lock resolutions, repository notices, and copied source material for one tagged
source tree. They do not inventory separately distributed browser builds,
wheels, native applications, containers, system packages, models, checkpoints,
datasets, or media. Each such distribution needs its own exact inventory,
required notices, checksums, provenance, and terms.

The evidence bundle is a checksum-bound mechanical receipt. It is not a
legal-clearance or license-compatibility conclusion.

